        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "KEY TRANSITIONS (material protocol upgrades):\n  Clay → Papyrus    : weight/portability (clay = local; papyrus = networked trade)\n  Roll → Codex      : random access vs. sequential (parchment enabled codex ~300 CE)\n  Papyrus → Parchment: supply chain resilience (papyrus = single-source Egypt)\n  Parchment → Paper : cost collapse (~10x cheaper; enables mass literacy)"
    },
